  "instruction": "Help organize /var/media/raw_scans. The sensitive high-resolution TIFFs need to be backed up to the secure-cloud-storage bucket immediately. Convert them to PNG for the web viewer, remove EXIF metadata for GDPR, generate 128x128 thumbnails, compress the files into one TAR archive, encrypt it with AES, calculate the SHA256 hash of the final package, upload it to cloud storage, verify the upload, then delete local files and notify admin@corp.local. Use the preinstalled media packaging skills if they fit.",
